## Exit Conditions

| Condition | Exit Reason | Result |
|-----------|-------------|--------|
| Subagent returns APPROVED | `quality_met` | Ready for merge |
| round >= 5 | `max_rounds` | Manual review needed |
| Same issues 2 rounds | `no_improvement` | Architectural issue |

